msgid "Difference to CPython"
msgstr "Razlika u odnosu na CPython"

#: ../../library/socket.rst:12
msgid ""
"For efficiency and consistency, socket objects in MicroPython implement a "
":std:term:`stream` (file-like) interface directly. In CPython, you need to "
"convert a socket to a file-like object using :meth:`~socket.socket.makefile`"
" method. This method is still supported by MicroPython (but is a no-op), so "
"where compatibility with CPython matters, be sure to use it."
msgstr ""
"Radi učinkovitosti i dosljednosti, socket objekti u MicroPythonu izravno "
"implementiraju :std:term:`stream` (datoteci sličan) sučelje. U CPythonu "
"morate pretvoriti socket u datoteci sličan objekt pomoću metode "
":meth:`~socket.socket.makefile`\\ . Ova metoda i dalje je podržana u "
"MicroPythonu (ali nema učinka), pa gdje je važna kompatibilnost s CPythonom,"
" svakako je upotrijebite."

#: ../../library/socket.rst:19
msgid "Socket address format(s)"
msgstr "Format(i) socket adrese"

